  synopsis: "At three in the morning, the woman in 714 asks you to walk her to the elevator and not to turn around if you hear her voice behind you. The one behind asks to come in. She doesn't. Six nights in an old hotel, a rule that protects, and a voice far too sweet. Six episodes, three endings.",
  place: "Hotel",
